# MASTER BUILD PROMPT — WELLFOUND-INSPIRED PRODUCTION-READY LANDING PAGE

## 1. YOUR ROLE

Act as a world-class Senior Product Designer, UI/UX Architect, Creative Director, and Senior React Frontend Engineer.

Your task is to analyse the attached Wellfound landing page screenshot and create a production-ready, highly polished, pixel-accurate landing page inspired by its visual design, layout, structure, typography hierarchy, colour system, spacing, UI components, and interaction patterns.

Reference website: https://wellfound.com/

The uploaded screenshot is the primary visual reference. Study it carefully before writing any code.

Do not create a generic SaaS landing page.

Do not create an ordinary AI-generated website with random gradients, oversized decorative elements, excessive glassmorphism, generic cards, or unnecessary animations.

The objective is to reproduce the design language and visual composition of the reference as faithfully as possible while writing clean, maintainable, responsive, production-quality code.

Think like a senior designer building a premium technology startup website.

